{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tow Game is a physics-based action game where you control a car being towed by a tow truck. Swing around the environment using the tow cable and earn points by causing chaos and destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE A NEW GAME MECHANIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can detach from the tow truck for up to 3 seconds before it pulls you back in with full force. Use that time to wreck the level, earn points, or take creative shortcuts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/8e7667b07241e8ca097eeb6229b55a06.poster.avif?t=1773214443\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/8e7667b07241e8ca097eeb6229b55a06.webm?t=1773214443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/8e7667b07241e8ca097eeb6229b55a06.mp4?t=1773214443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face uniquely designed levels with one-of-a-kind challenges! Play strategically and plan ahead, or dive headfirst into pure chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/12af658b79d3f0f7a856cba40da18348.poster.avif?t=1773214443\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/12af658b79d3f0f7a856cba40da18348.webm?t=1773214443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/12af658b79d3f0f7a856cba40da18348.mp4?t=1773214443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW SONGS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides hard-to-reach cassettes. Collect all of them to unlock a new track for your radio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/314f6a4834fa5c1003f12c843382962d.poster.avif?t=1773214443\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/314f6a4834fa5c1003f12c843382962d.webm?t=1773214443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/314f6a4834fa5c1003f12c843382962d.mp4?t=1773214443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic and fun physics simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenges for the ultimate skill test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original songs to unlock</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690870?t=1773214443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690870?t=1773214443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/ee4481b75d3f85b3138de6243899bbe0f1e2762b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773214443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/ee4481b75d3f85b3138de6243899bbe0f1e2762b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773214443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"desc